      "transcript": "ਰੈਣਿ ਗਵਾਈ ਸੋਇ ਕੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00003",
      "start_time": 36.16,
      "end_time": 43.8,
      "transcript": "ਦਿਵਸੁ ਗਵਾਇਆ ਖਾਇ"
